        "quote": "(a) Owning, Keeping, Maintaining. Except as allowed by subsection (d) of this section, it shall be unlawful for any person, with no requirement of a culpable mental state, to own or keep in his or her possession or under his or her control or maintain any live exotic or captive wild animal within the City limits.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:6.20.010:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
