          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1260,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:6.20.010:block:9",
          "start": 1246
        },
        "quote": "(iv) Circuses.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:6.20.010:block:9#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 6.20.010 block 10",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 10,
          "component_id": "dbf6aa84-dab1-5156-a2ca-3b5776cd6e62",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1360,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:6.20.010:block:10",
          "start": 1261
        },
        "quote": "(v) Persons designated and licensed as animal rehabilitators by the State Fish and Game Commission.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:6.20.010:block:10#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 6.20.010 block 11",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 11,
          "component_id": "48d0b341-a083-5759-8bae-85e2962750bb",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1655,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:6.20.010:block:11",
          "start": 1361
        },
        "quote": "(vi) Persons listed in subsections (d)(2)(i) through (d)(2)(v) of this section who are temporarily transporting such animals through the City, except that circuses and carnivals need not be licensed by the City if merely temporarily transporting an otherwise prohibited animal through the City.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:6.20.010:block:11#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 6.20.010 block 12",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 12,
          "component_id": "6851a240-1d2b-5be5-93eb-e54bd3642047",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2034,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:6.20.010:block:12",
          "start": 1656
        },
        "quote": "(e) Secure and Sanitary Quarters. All persons and institutions listed in subsection (d) of this section must ensure that all animal enclosures are secure, as defined in TMC 6.05.010 , so as to prevent their escape, conform to the provisions of the nuisance ordinances of the City and are maintained in a clean and sanitary condition for purposes of limiting objectionable odors.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:6.20.010:block:12#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 6.20.010 block 13",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 13,
          "component_id": "3acc8cca-a059-5a39-b8ac-c5bc8b5ff0f8",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2410,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:6.20.010:block:13",
          "start": 2035
        },
        "quote": "(f) Licensing. All persons and institutions listed in subsection (d) of this section must be properly licensed, if so required, by any rule or regulation promulgated under the authority of Federal statute enacted by the United States, or by any statute enacted by the State, or by any rule or regulation promulgated by any agency or department as authorized by State statute.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:6.20.010:block:13#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 6.20.010 block 14",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 14,
          "component_id": "3147b6f0-f5c5-5347-b603-a50879d1fc3e",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2567,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:6.20.010:block:14",
          "start": 2411
        },
        "quote": "(g) Violations. A violation of any provision of this section shall constitute a new and separate offense each calendar day the violation continues to exist.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:6.20.010:block:14#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 6.20.010 block 15",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 15,
          "component_id": "37b04f5e-2243-5079-95fd-b6030dcef242",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2867,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:6.20.010:block:15",
          "start": 2568
        },
        "quote": "(h) Destruction or Removal of Prohibited Animals. Upon conviction of a violation of this section, the judge of the Municipal Court of the City may order the owner, keeper, possessor or harborer to destroy or remove from the City any animal prohibited under this section. (Ord. 20106 § 39, 12-19-17.)",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:6.20.010:block:15#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
